#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-delay]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-delay[quarkus.oidc.connection-delay]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The maximum amount of time connecting to the currently unavailable OIDC server will be attempted for. The number of times the connection request will be repeated is calculated by dividing the value of this property by 2. For example, setting it to `20S` will allow for requesting the connection up to 10 times with a 2 seconds delay between the retries. Note this property is only effective when the initial OIDC connection is created, for example, when requesting a well-known OIDC configuration. Use the 'connection-retry-count' property to support trying to re-establish an already available connection which may have been dropped.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_CONNECTION_DELAY+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-delay[quarkus.oidc.atraso-de-conexão]`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-delay]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-delay[quarkus.oidc.connection-delay]`"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-delay[quarkus.oidc.atraso-de-conexão]`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The maximum amount of time connecting to the currently unavailable OIDC server will be attempted for. The number of times the connection request will be repeated is calculated by dividing the value of this property by 2. For example, setting it to `20S` will allow for requesting the connection up to 10 times with a 2 seconds delay between the retries. Note this property is only effective when the initial OIDC connection is created, for example, when requesting a well-known OIDC configuration. Use the 'connection-retry-count' property to support trying to re-establish an already available connection which may have been dropped."
msgstr "Este valor representa o tempo máximo durante o qual serão feitas tentativas de conexão com o servidor OIDC atualmente indisponível. O número de vezes que a solicitação de conexão será repetida é calculado dividindo-se o valor desta propriedade por 2. Por exemplo, definir esse valor para `20S` permitirá solicitar a conexão até 10 vezes, com um intervalo de 2 segundos entre as tentativas. Observe que esta propriedade só tem efeito quando a conexão OIDC inicial é criada, por exemplo, ao solicitar uma configuração OIDC bem conhecida. Utilize a propriedade 'connection-retry-count' para permitir a tentativa de restabelecimento de uma conexão já disponível que possa ter sido interrompida."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_CONNECTION_DELAY+++[]"
msgstr "Variável de ambiente: env_var_with_copy_button:QUARKUS_OIDC_CONNECTION_DELAY[]"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count[quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The number of times an attempt to re-establish an already available connection will be repeated for. Note this property is different to the `connection-delay` property which is only effective during the initial OIDC connection creation. This property is used to try to recover the existing connection which may have been temporarily lost. For example, if a request to the OIDC token endpoint fails due to a connection exception then the request will be retried for a number of times configured by this property.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_OIDC_CONNECTION_RETRY_COUNT+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count[quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count]`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "[[quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count]]`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count[quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count]`"
msgstr "`link:#quarkus-oidc_quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count[quarkus.oidc.connection-retry-count]`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The number of times an attempt to re-establish an already available connection will be repeated for. Note this property is different to the `connection-delay` property which is only effective during the initial OIDC connection creation. This property is used to try to recover the existing connection which may have been temporarily lost. For example, if a request to the OIDC token endpoint fails due to a connection exception then the request will be retried for a number of times configured by this property."
msgstr "O número de vezes que será repetida uma tentativa de restabelecer uma conexão já disponível. Observe que esta propriedade é diferente da propriedade ``connection-delay`` , que só tem efeito durante a criação inicial da conexão OIDC. Esta propriedade é utilizada para tentar recuperar a conexão existente que possa ter sido temporariamente perdida. Por exemplo, se uma solicitação ao endpoint do token OIDC falhar devido a uma exceção de conexão, a solicitação será repetida pelo número de vezes configurado por esta propriedade."

